.decl sd_message(code: symbol, value: symbol)
sd_message("SPD001","backend capability selection belongs at the late physical boundary").
sd_message("SPD002","semantic dispatch must use typed plan contracts, not concrete step types").
sd_message("SPD003","semantic dispatch must not compare runtime step type names").
sd_message("SPD004","dialect presence must not select ServerPlan behavior; make the default lowering unconditional and implement backend variation with the existing _lower_xxx hook (or _compile_xxx only when preserving the same lowered step). A dialect may be consumed as a required value for syntax rendering after lowering, but its presence must not choose semantics, placement, compilation, fallback, or result handling").
sd_message("SPD005","BaseServerPlan may use only the closed public executor-owned execution scope and orchestration contract; connection state, transport capabilities, and undeclared executor surfaces belong to the executor").
